---
profile: production
# var-naming[no-role-prefix] accepts only the bare role name as a prefix (host_, nomad_), which is ambiguous for roles
# named host or nomad and collides with other collections. Every role argument is wherry_<role>_* instead, and shared
# values are collection-level wherry_* variables the role defaults reference (Red Hat CoP 5.2).
skip_list:
  - var-naming[no-role-prefix]
